<title>USA: Cell Pathways closes $17.5 mln private financing.</title>
<headline>Cell Pathways closes $17.5 mln private financing.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CONSHOHOCKEN, Pa. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cell Pathways Inc said Wednesday it has closed a $17.5 million private financing.</p>
<p>The company said it will use the proceeds to expand clinical trials of its lead product, FGN-1, into new areas: sporadic colon polyp formation; cervical dysplasia; and the prevention of tumor recurrence in prostate and breast cancer.</p>
<p>The proceeds will also finance the relocation of its facilities to suburban Philadelphia, the privately owned pharmaceutical company said.</p>
